  "description": "A sorted array of **distinct** integers was rotated some number of times (e.g. `[0,1,2,4,5,6,7]` → `[4,5,6,7,0,1,2]`). Return the minimum element in O(log n).\n\n### Input\n- Line 1: `nums`, space-separated integers.\n\n### Output\nOne integer.\n\n### Constraints\n- `1 <= nums.length <= 6000`\n- `-5000 <= nums[i] <= 5000`\n- All values are distinct.",
  "signature": {
    "params": [
      {
        "name": "nums",
        "type": "int[]"
      }
    ],
    "returns": "int"
  },
